data: {"id": "709c31d7245e4057-final", "run_id": "709c31d7245e4057", "seq": 2660, "ts_ms": 1789373006891, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v13/workload` | Terminating | Pod 处于正常终止流程中（Grace Period 内），尚未构成异常阻塞。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | Normal Killing 77s Stopping container app (fact-505c8d058132) | 证实 Pod 已执行终止操作，处于被 Kubelet 强制或优雅关闭的阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | Normal Killing 48s Stopping container app (fact-0cdee52ee7b4) | 证实停止容器的动作在 29s 内重复确认 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubelet | Pod Status: Terminating (fact-9c70bd9a5bce); Phase: Running (fact-f429cfc4ae66) | 状态不一致，表明 Pod 逻辑上已被标记为删除，但底层容器仍在运行 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | container.spec | memory limit: 32Mi; cpu limit: 50m (fact-2d0a5c21a06d, fact-af1292312253) | 确认资源配额，非资源超限导致 CrashLoop |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | 08:01:37 application started (fact-3d8b3c619ef9) | 确认应用正常启动 |\n| 6 | Logging | elasticsearch | 08:01:38 SIGTERM received; waiting (fact-cdce40df7375) | 关键证据：应用接收到了 SIGTERM 信号，并在执行等待清理逻辑 |\n| 7 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 0 (fact-e9ef3ed4bd69) | 证实无重启风暴，非因健康检查失败或 OOM 导致的异常重启 |\n\n日志 (fact-6) 显示应用处理了 SIGTERM 并进入等待状态，而 K8s State (fact-3) 显示容器仍处于运行中，这直接印证了 Pod 因应用未能在 Grace Period 内主动退出而处于正常的终止流程中。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n外部控制器发起删除请求（未确认） → Kubelet 向容器发送 SIGTERM 信号（K8s Event） → 应用捕获信号并进入等待清理状态（Logging） → Pod 状态转为 Terminating 但尚未结束（K8s State）\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认结论**：当前 Pod (`aiops-case-v13/workload`) 处于正常的优雅终止流程中。\n根据日志事实 (fact-6)，应用已成功接收 Kubelet 发送的 SIGTERM 信号（由事实 1、2 确认），并明确显示“waiting”状态，这表明应用正在按预期进行清理工作，并未因 Crash、OOM 或配置错误而异常退出。由于应用未在设定的宽限期内主动退出，Kubernetes 将其维持在 `Terminating` 状态等待最终完成。\n\n**不足/未知**：\n触发此次删除的源头控制器（如 Deployment 缩容、Job 完成等）未在现有事实中确认，但不影响当前 Pod 行为本身的正常性判断。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 69.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v13/workload: 69.6s (Evidence 64.3s, RCA 5.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v13/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 102.73, "metrics": {"run_id": "709c31d7245e4057", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 102.7365574836731, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 102736.5574836731, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 97429.17490005493, "tool_calls": 21, "executed_tool_calls": 17, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 21, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 12063.474893569946, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4926.703453063965}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22505.141496658325, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 69564.13102149963, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10639.923095703125, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

